---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="留言板" index>
  <div class="wrap" style="padding-top: 44px; padding-bottom: 56px; max-width: 680px;">
    <div class="term">
      <div class="term-bar"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class="title">豆芽@blog: ~/guestbook — zsh</span></div>
      <div class="term-body">
        <span class="line"><span class="prompt">➜ ~</span> <span class="cmd">./guestbook --open</span></span>

        <div class="gb-content">
          <h2>留言板</h2>
          <p>随便写点什么——路过的痕迹、想聊的话题、对博客的建议，或者只是打个招呼。登录 GitHub 即可留言，支持 Markdown。</p>
        </div>

        <div class="gb-comments">
          <script
            src="https://giscus.app/client.js"
            data-repo="zhaojiale001016/zhaojiale001016.github.io"
            data-repo-id="R_kgDOVjsqow"
            data-category="General"
            data-category-id="DIC_kwDOVjsqo84DKcIg"
            data-mapping="specific"
            data-term="guestbook"
            data-strict="0"
            data-reactions-enabled="1"
            data-emit-metadata="0"
            data-input-position="top"
            data-theme="light"
            data-lang="zh-CN"
            crossorigin="anonymous"
            async
          ></script>
        </div>

        <span class="line" style="margin-top: 18px;"><span class="prompt">➜ ~</span> <span class="cursor">&nbsp;</span></span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>

<style>
  .gb-content { margin-top: 16px; }
  .gb-content h2 { font-size: 1.3rem; color: var(--green); margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .gb-content p { font-size: .85rem; color: var(--ink-2); line-height: 1.7; }
  .gb-comments { margin-top: 20px; }
</style>
